There is no specific ping command, but you can set a new route to test
the interface:
	# route add host1 yourGateway -dev tu1

If you ping to host1, the packet will go over interface tu1.
to show the routes type
	# netstat -r

to delete the route ty<pe:
	# route delete host1 yourGateway


