Dave,

maxusers is part of the proc subsystem.
Its value can get retrieved using: sysconfig -q proc|grep maxusers
To set its value place a similar entry in /etc/sysconfigtab  :
proc:
maxusers = 1024

v5 can set some values dynamically :
sysconfig -r proc maxusers=1024
(sysconfigtab should be edited so the changes are kept after reboot)

To increase the number of pty device files:
in /dev
MAKEDEV PTY_1 or PTY_1 etc...

hope this helps
Nick


