Hi,

You can set parameters in

/var/X11/Xserver.conf

for example: 4D10 eg. Elsa Gloria Synergy 8MB, 
resolution 1280x1024,
24-bit true color server,
vertical frequency 75 Hz
add to the line 
...
...
! you specify command line arguments here
args <
        -pn -screen 1280x1024 -depth 24 -vsync 75
>
...
...

and restart the X-server.
/sbin/init.d/xlogin stop
after the screen is blue, hit return and login as root and type
/sbin/init.d/xlogin start

- you have installed O3D?
- your graphic card have more than 2MB video ram (min. 8MB)?

ciao,
