In response to my post (see below) about increasing the size of a disk
partition and then trying to make this extra disk space available to an
advfs fileset, it seems that this cannot be done.  You have to backup your
filesets, remove the corresponding domain, and then recreate the domain,
and restore your filesets.  Only then will the fileset make use of the
larger partition.

